WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Watch two targets appear in a quick stream. Sometimes the second one goes unnoticed.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers call that an attentional blink.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
An experiment looked at three months of intensive meditation training and a laboratory task.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
It did not test a meditation app or an MP3 course.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Zen12 sells structured recordings. Product-specific science needs product-specific evidence.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a quiet twelve-minute task first. Decide what convenience is worth.
